### 회원가입
POST http://localhost:8080/members/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "uichan@example.com",
  "password": "pw1234",
  "name": "의찬"
}

### --- 모바일 흐름 ---
### 토큰 로그인 → 응답으로 accessToken 받음
POST http://localhost:8080/members/login/token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "uichan@example.com", "password": "pw1234" }

