### 토큰 없이 호출 → 401
POST http://localhost:8080/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-05-30",
  "name": "브라운",
  "timeId": 1,
  "themeId": 1
}

### 위조된 토큰 → 401
POST http://localhost:8080/reservations
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer invalid.token.here

{
  "date": "2026-05-30",
  "name": "브라운",
  "timeId": 1,
  "themeId": 1
}